section(class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-7xl flex-col gap-6 px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8")
    div(class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-sky-200 bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,_#eff6ff_0%,_#ffffff_55%,_#e0f2fe_100%)] p-8 shadow-sm")
        div(class="flex flex-col gap-5 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between")
            div(class="max-w-3xl")
                p(class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-sky-700") OpenID Connect Provider
                h1(class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-950") RP 등록, discovery/JWKS 배포, authorize·logout 검증
                p(class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-7 text-zinc-600")
                    | Authorization Code, PKCE, userinfo, end session 흐름에 필요한 계약과 시뮬레이션 결과를 OIDC 전용 운영 화면으로 정리합니다.
            div(class="flex flex-wrap gap-2")
                a(routerLink="/oidc/register", [class]="tabClass('register')") Register RP
                a(routerLink="/oidc/publish", [class]="tabClass('publish')") Publish Discovery
                a(routerLink="/oidc/authorizecheck", [class]="tabClass('authorizecheck')") Authorize Check
                a(routerLink="/oidc/logoutcheck", [class]="tabClass('logoutcheck')") Logout Check

    div(class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm")
        div(*ngIf="isTab('register')")
            wiz-portal-oidcidp-rp-register

        div(*ngIf="isTab('publish')")
            wiz-portal-oidcidp-provider-publish

        div(*ngIf="isTab('authorizecheck')")
            wiz-portal-oidcidp-authorize-check

        div(*ngIf="isTab('logoutcheck')")
            wiz-portal-oidcidp-logout-check